>arpi, tell me about servers

"It's outdated and takes up a lot of space, but server farms of old equipment
are cheap. The Crawls can break down and recycle this equipment to make it last
almost forever. And the drones keep watch over all of it," Arpi explains.

>arpi, tell me about drones

"They're not as tough or as smart as they look, but most people don't get past
the tasers to find out."

Arpi's tone turns more serious. "Their weakness is their power source. The
charging station. Disable it!"

